# Word Game Solver

A lightweight solver for word games that can parse a screenshot or take typed guesses and suggest the best next answer.

## What it does

- Solves standard Wordle puzzles using green/yellow/gray feedback
- Filters candidate words from a dictionary
- Recommends the best next guess
- Detects a Wordle-like board from a screenshot
- Supports a custom word-solving mode

## Quick start

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python main.py --game wordle --history SLATE:GY___ --history CRANE:YY___
```

## Example commands

```bash
python main.py --game wordle --history SLATE:GY___ --history CRANE:YY___
python main.py --game custom --must-contain A --pattern "*A***" --length 5
python main.py --game wordle --image screenshot.png
```

## Notes

This project is intentionally simple and modular so it can grow into a larger solver for different word games and board layouts.

